{"requestId":"ea5e8923bd784acb9f8d9e45879fc4f0","modelId":"hy3","modelName":"Hy3","isHelperMessage":false,"traceId":"6028611455b21931dd0c9dd15f70a1af","toolStatus":{"chatcmpl-tool-9c7f79a7abddba0b":{"ready":true,"status":"executed","args":{"filePath":"/home/alvin/graphtell/graphtell/crates/gt-app/tests/view_layer.rs","offset":488,"limit":70},"result":{"status":"success","success":true,"result":{"type":"read_file_result","path":"/home/alvin/graphtell/graphtell/crates/gt-app/tests/view_layer.rs","content":"   488:/// ③ 视图确有可画的内容（资源边或直连记账，二选一）。
   489:#[test]
   490:#[ignore = "需要 CRMEB-master 样本：设置 GRAPHTELL_SAMPLE_DIR 后运行 `cargo test -- --ignored` 才会执行"]
   491:fn event_view_syntactic_accessors_collapse_to_orphans() {
   492:    let Some(b) = built() else {
   493:        eprintln!("{}", skip());
   494:        return;
   495:    };
   496:    let views = view_svc(&b);
   497:    let cands = views
   498:        .candidates(b.project_id, "event", 20, None, None)
   499:        .expect("candidates");
   500:    let Some(top) = cands.first() else {
   501:        eprintln!("事件视角没有候选，跳过");
   502:        return;
   503:    };
   504:    let ov = views
   505:        .object_view(b.project_id, "event", top.id, Some(2))
   506:        .expect("object_view");
   507:    assert_eq!(ov.center.kind, "Event", "事件视角中心应是 Event");
   508:
   509:    // ① 画布上绝不能出现桥边（语法端点不可见，画出来即违反"画布只画语义节点"）。
   510:    assert!(
   511:        !ov.edges
   512:            .iter()
   513:            .any(|e| e.kind == "HandledBy" || e.kind == "Triggers"),
   514:        "事件视角不应画出 HandledBy/Triggers 这类桥边，应折叠进 orphans：{:?}",
   515:        ov.edges.iter().map(|e| &e.kind).collect::<Vec<_>>()
   516:    );
   517:
   518:    // ② 直连的语法访问方必须降级进 orphans，且带"它对事件做了什么"。
   519:    let handled = ov
   520:        .orphans
   521:        .iter()
   522:        .filter(|o| o.edge_kind == "HandledBy")
   523:        .count();
   524:    let triggers = ov
   525:        .orphans
   526:        .iter()
   527:        .filter(|o| o.edge_kind == "Triggers")
   528:        .count();
   529:    assert!(
   530:        handled + triggers > 0,
   531:        "事件视角应把直连监听方/触发方记进 orphans，否则就是静默省略：{:?}",
   532:        ov.orphans
   533:            .iter()
   534:            .map(|o| &o.edge_kind)
   535:            .collect::<Vec<_>>()
   536:    );
   537:
   538:    // `Triggers` 这类只有 1 跳的直接边必须给出触发点（接触点位置），否则抽屉只剩
   539:    // "没有逐跳证据可查"，其实 `event('X')` 那一行就在图里。
   540:    for o in ov.orphans.iter().filter(|o| o.edge_kind == "Triggers") {
   541:        assert!(
   542:            !o.name.is_empty(),
   543:            "Triggers orphan 必须带名字（触发方）"
   544:        );
   545:        assert!(
   546:            o.location.is_some(),
   547:            "Triggers orphan {} 应给出触发点（location）",
   548:            o.name
   549:        );
   550:    }
   551:
   552:    // ③ 视图不空：要么经监听器画出了资源边，要么至少有直连记账 —— 总之不能是一张空图。
   553:    assert!(
   554:        !ov.edges.is_empty() || !ov.orphans.is_empty(),
